<div class="sec"><div class="st">Coach's Notes</div><div class="recs"><ol><li>🎯 Eliza Stewart's peak exit velo is 70.0 mph right now. At a 1-2% monthly gain, that's 72.1 mph in 2 months. Every session adds MPH!</li><li>🔫 Barrel rate at 3.4% — work on centering the ball on the barrel. More centered contact = more carry and distance.</li><li>💪 Building hard-hit power takes time. Every session of tracking the ball deep and swinging with intent adds pop to the barrel.</li><li>🏆 18 sessions logged at The Cage — that's real dedication! Every rep builds the athlete you're becoming. See you at the next cage session!</li></ol></div></div>
<div class="sec"><div class="st">Monthly Progress</div><div class="recs" style="padding:10px;">
